KotOR:CE licensing overview

The source contains separately licensed components. This overview does not
relicense third-party work or grant rights to proprietary games or assets.

The combined engine incorporates GPL-2.0-only OpenJK code. Distribution of that
combined engine must comply with GNU GPL version 2; see COPYING and LICENSING.md.

The K12 foundation retains its authors' CC0 1.0 dedication. Its complete original
license text is preserved in LICENSES/K12-CC0-1.0.txt. Existing per-file notices
and the component notices in LICENSES remain applicable. Do not interpret CC0 as
a license for the entire combined engine, proprietary game assets or trademarks.

Read LICENSING.md for selected dependency alternatives and data/rights limits.
